# Regenerates assets/demo.gif. Run from the repo root: vhs demo/record.tape
# Requires: npm run build (dist/ must exist), vhs (brew install vhs)
Output assets/demo.gif
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 480
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms

Type "node demo/demo-driver.mjs"
Enter
Sleep 7s
